Equipment.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Chapter 5</a><br /> <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/Grim%20Fictions/grimfictions_charsheet_small_skari.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Character Sheet</a><br /> <br /> <b>World of Adventure!</b><br /> My attempt at conversion-turned-abomination for Adventure! into GMC rules. Incomplete.<br /> <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/World%20of%20Adventure/World%20of%20Adventure%20-%202013-10-31.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Main File</a> | <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/World%20of%20Adventure/WoA4P.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Character Sheet</a><br /> <br /> <b>Maps</b><br /> Occasionally, I make maps.<br /> <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/maps_and_stuff/\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Maps Page</a></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":308,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","user":"Skari-dono","date":". 05-08-2015, 07:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T05:00:09-08:00","id":19660,"title":"","content":"As some of you may know, I\u00b4m currently making a role-playing game and I\u00b4ve started initial playtesting. Well, let's call it a fantasy heartbreaker. So far we've made characters and we did a short play session yesterday. There was no combat but some dice-rolling took place. The system is fairly simple, you roll as many d6 as dictated by your Trait and count any die that shows 4-6 as a Strike. Yesterday showed that success rate can turn very high, especially if you spend an Effort point to add a Skill rating to the roll (more dice). The reason you spend Effort to add Skills is because this way you can spend more Effort to add more Skills (you are not limited to a single Skill in this system).<br /> <br /> About the characters they made, they stuck to a &quot;traveling musicians&quot; theme:<br /> Embris violinist (premade racial template, patronizing attitude)<br /> Rok lutist (also premade template, 4-handed eagle-folk)<br /> Gnome cleptomaniac/flutist (he made the racial template, outcast from his own people)<br /> ANIMAL (drummist, one-of-a-kind creature, based on the Muppets' Animal)<br /> <br /> The idea was that you can make the character you want to play. So far, the game seems to have succeeded on that front.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T01:22:57-08:00","id":37754,"title":"","content":"The Emerald Samurai website is currently down for an unknown reason. The webmaster will get into it as soon as she finishes her day job but it could take a few hours, especially if the problem is with the hosting company.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, if you are looking to download something specific, you can PM me or leave a reply here below and I'll try to get the files to you some other way.<br /> <br /> <b>EDIT:</b> The website seems to be working now. Let me know if something is amiss. There are still some things that may not work since some changes that were made might take up to a day or two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":308,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","user":"Skari-dono","date":". 12-27-2013, 07:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T14:29:12-08:00","id":69427,"title":"","content":"Added a new post on my Emerald Samurai website (see link in sig) discussing what I've been up to lately. Hope some of you find it interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T06:13:50-08:00","id":71934,"title":"","content":"I added some new maps to the Emerald Samurai page. The idea with the two I added today was to make them easy to print. They're technically the same map, but one of them has whitened ocean for even easier printing. <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/maps_and_stuff/\" target=\"_blank\">LINK</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T02:26:27-08:00","id":74175,"title":"","content":"And two more maps have been added. I've also written a new post on the front page, but really it is the maps your should check out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T14:59:39-08:00","id":79670,"title":"","content":"I've had these &quot;printer friendly&quot; versions of the Exalted character sheets hanging around my website for a while now and only just noticed that I hadn't linked to them here. So now I have added links to the printer friendly versions, which are a lot like the B/W versions but are not as demanding on ink.<br /> <br /> I also did some work on the Solar sheet, which is the one that is linked to and can be found <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/Resources/Exalted/Version%203/BlackWhite/Printer%20Friendly/Exalted%20v3-0-3%20PrFr.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Minor fixes and alterations really, so I've dubbed it version 3.0.3, even though I've never really understood how these numbers work.<br /> <br /> Speaking of which, I've been playing around in Illustrator some more for my own games, learning new tricks and stuff for character-sheet-making. I'm going to give it some more thought, but I think I'll try to make a v4 of the Solar sheet before the EX3 gets released. The first page will undergo the biggest changes but I plan on making the sheet less ink-demanding and easier to alter later on. The layout of the first page might even get a complete overhaul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T04:21:13-08:00","id":83083,"title":"","content":"I just finished version 4 of my Exalted character-sheet and have uploaded it to my website for your enjoyment.<br /> <br /> Biggest changes are structural, since I redid the sheet nearly from scratch in Illustrator and gave most sections of the sheet their own layer. The sheet has nearly 50 layers. By doing this, I hope that making changes to the sheet will become much easier, since I can select everything within the same layer with a single click (so changing fonts is a breeze).<br /> <br /> I also replaced the Exalted logo with my own. It is not as cool as the official logo, but it will be easier for me to alter it as needed.<br /> <br /> I made one sheet with the material from the Scroll of Errata and one without. Both can be found <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/exalted_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, under version 4.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T09:57:23-07:00","id":92329,"title":"","content":"I've added more stuff to the <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/exalted_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted page</a> of my website!<br /> <br /> First of all, I've finished making new Dragon-Blooded sheets that fit the v4 theme. In addition, I've made three bonus sheets: one for extra Charms, one for Combos (in case you are using them) and one for more detailed character info, such as backstory, equipment and so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T06:54:28-07:00","id":93453,"title":"","content":"Added a sheet for NPCs for Exalted. It is a universal sheet, so you can use it for almost any type of character. You can find it on the Exalted page of my website.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T10:51:12-07:00","id":104158,"title":"","content":"Added some new stuff:<br /> <br /> Character-sheets for Lunar Exalted, both with and without the errata material, with additional page for shapeshifting. Took a while to get it the way I wanted.<br /> <br /> Three bonus sheets for Exalted: One for Extras (room for two different types of extras), one for additional Spells (either Sorcery or Necromancy) and one for additional Artifacts and Manses (along with a small section for the Cult Background).<br /> <br /> All the sheets can be found on the Exalted Resources page of my website, or directly through the links above. Hope you enjoy.<br /> <br /> I think I will take a short break before I move on to the Sidereals. I've been wanting to make a standard sheet for Savage Worlds for the last week or two so I might do that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T03:16:22-07:00","id":113220,"title":"","content":"I've added some new character-sheets to my lists. First of all, White Wolf / Onyx Path related, I've finished the Sidereal sheet with included Astrology page. Good fun. I don't know if there are any errors; I based it on my previous Sidereal sheet and read through the Scroll of Errata, but I didn't spot any noteworthy changes. If you know more about Exalted than I do, particularly about Sidereals, be sure to let me know if you find any errors I should revise. As before, I made one version with the material from Scroll of Errata and one without.<br /> <br /> Second, I finished my first character-sheet for Savage Worlds. I did experiment a little with it, particularly with making the Attributes be traced in circles. I kinda like how it looks but now the Attributes are taking way too much space for it to be worth it. I plan on making other sheets with different layout, so you don't have to worry if you don't like it.<br /> <br /> The Sidereal sheets can be found on my <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/exalted_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Resources</a> page.<br /> The Savage Worlds sheet can be found on my new <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/savageworlds/\" target=\"_blank\">Savage Worlds Resources</a> page.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T04:37:43-07:00","id":114659,"title":"","content":"Abyssal sheets are done for Exalted. You can find a direct link in the list above or you can check out my <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/exalted_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Resources</a> page.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page<